@@ -0,0 +1,16 @@
+# ELXVRO Blocks v0.35.0 — Ultimate Adventure
+
+The 100-stage map is unchanged. Every tenth existing level has a Crystal Guardian
+boss encounter: matched jewels deplete HP, and the guardian periodically places
+blockers without eliminating every legal move. Four-jewel runs mint directional
+rockets, five-jewel runs mint color prisms, and 6+ runs mint lightning crosses.
+Activated specials clear cells in real time with bounded chain reactions and
+shattered-crystal effects.
+
+Crystal Vault gains a weekly quest (five distinct newly completed stages,
++240 coins, once per local Monday-to-Sunday week) and four mastery badges
+for 10, 25, 50 and 100 completed levels. Android weekly rewards and quest
+progress are committed in the same native preferences file as Adventure saves.
+
+Graphics and particles remain bounded, asynchronous effects block overlapping
+input, and successful APK builds must pass two Flutter test runs.
